{"step_index":1543,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-11-02T19:38:24Z","input_tokens":2572,"cache_read_tokens":68623,"output_tokens":1322,"thinking":"The plan is to build a test script for the invoice text parser. It will use Node.js to validate the `invoiceTextParser.js` functionality. Initially, the script will focus on table-anchor boundary slicing, ensuring that header addresses are correctly identified and excluded from item parsing. It will then proceed to test the right-to-left numeric column parser, focusing on cases of embedded numbers in product descriptions.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"run_command","args":{"CommandLine":"node -e '\nimport(\"./utils/invoiceTextParser.js\").then(parser => {\n  const sampleInvoice = `\nSHRI BALAJI HARDWARE & ELECTRICALS\nShop No 12, Sector 18, Industrial Area, Sonipat, Haryana\nGSTIN: 07AABCS1429B1Z2\nInvoice No: SB/2026/089\nDate: 15-08-2026\n\nS.No | Description | HSN/SAC | Qty | Rate | Amount\n1 | 2.5 sq mm Copper Wire Coil (90m) | 8544 | 10 NOS | 1,200.00 | 12,000.00\n2 | 20W LED Batten Tubelight | 9405 | 5 PCS | 450.00 | 2,250.00\n3 | Bosch All-in-One Metal Hand Tool Kit | 8206 | 1 SET | 2,535.00 | 2,535.00\n4 | Taparia Universal Tool Kit | 8206 | 1 NOS | 1,270.00 | 1,270.00\n\nSubtotal: 18,055.00\nCGST @ 9%: 1,624.95\nSGST @ 9%: 1,624.95\nTotal in Words: TWENTY ONE THOUSAND THREE HUNDRED AND FIVE RUPEES ONLY\nGrand Total: 774\nBank: State Bank of India\nA/c: 382910482910\nIFSC: SBIN0001234\n`;\n\n  const parsed = parser.parseInvoiceText(sampleInvoice, \"sample.pdf\");\n  console.log(\"Vendor:\", parsed.vendor_name);\n  console.log(\"GSTIN:\", parsed.gstin);\n  console.log(\"Invoice No:\", parsed.invoice_no);\n  console.log(\"Items count:\", parsed.items.length);\n  parsed.items.forEach((it, idx) => {\n    console.log(`Item ${idx + 1}: ${it.description} | Qty: ${it.quantity} | Rate: ${it.unit_rate} | Total: ${it.total_amount}`);\n  });\n  console.log(\"Subtotal:\", parsed.subtotal);\n  console.log(\"CGST:\", parsed.cgst, \"SGST:\", parsed.sgst);\n  console.log(\"Declared Total:\", parsed.declared_total);\n  console.log(\"Total Declared:\", parsed.total_declared);\n\n  // Assertions\n  if (parsed.items.length !== 4) throw new Error(\"Expected 4 items, got \" + parsed.items.length);\n  if (parsed.declared_total === 774) throw new Error(\"774 was not rejected!\");\n  if (parsed.declared_total !== parsed.total_declared) throw new Error(\"declared_total and total_declared not synchronized!\");\n  if (parsed.items[0].description.includes(\"8544\")) throw new Error(\"HSN leaked into description!\");\n  if (parsed.items[0].quantity !== 10 || parsed.items[0].unit_rate !== 1200 || parsed.items[0].total_amount !== 12000) {\n    throw new Error(\"Item 1 math or RTL parse error!\");\n  }\n  console.log(\"✅ All JS Invoice Parser tests PASSED!\");\n}).catch(err => {\n  console.error(\"❌ Test FAILED:\", err);\n  process.exit(1);\n});\n'","WaitMsBeforeAsync":5000,"toolSummary":"Run Node.js parser verification test"}}]}
